#Description: Q11. Write a program that asks the user for a string (only single space between words) and returns an estimate of how many words are in the string.(Hint: Count numebr of spaces)
string = input('Enter a series of words: ')
total = 1
for x in string:
    if x == ' ':
        total += 1
print(f'There are {total} words in that string')